Package: tessera
Title: Social Network Analysis Dashboard
Version: 0.13.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Abhik", "Roy", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for social network analysis. Turns an
    edge list into an interactive map with a plain language reading
    panel for general readers, and a research tier with extended
    centralities, a choice of community detection algorithms, global
    diagnostics, dyad and triad census, and reproducible script export.
    All computation is local.
